WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:05.250
If you're looking for the true lead characters
of Star Wars, look no further than C-3PO and

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:05.840
R2-D2.

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:11.260
Together they're one of fiction's greatest
duos, and the real POV characters of the franchise.

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:13.820
Let's take a look at the saga from their point
of view.

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:19.780
R2-D2 came from the planet Naboo, where he
was one of several nearly identical astromech

00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:23.160
droids stationed on Queen Padmé Amidala's
royal starship.

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:28.000
When the Jedi Qui-Gon Jinn and his apprentice
Obi-Wan Kenobi helped the Queen escape from

00:00:28.109 --> 00:00:33.640
captivity during a blockade by the Trade Federation,
the starship was fired upon by ships hoping

00:00:33.649 --> 00:00:35.190
to recapture Amidala.

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:40.080
A bunch of droids, including R2-D2, exited
the ship to make repairs from the outside.

00:00:40.149 --> 00:00:44.380
While several other droids were blown off
the ship and destroyed, R2 survived and made

00:00:44.380 --> 00:00:46.400
the repairs that enabled the ship to escape.

00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:51.140
He was personally thanked by the Queen, and
from that point on served her more directly.

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:55.920
When Amidala's ship stopped on the planet
Tatooine, they met C-3PO, a protocol droid

00:00:55.920 --> 00:01:00.160
that lacked his outer casing, which made him
look like a metal skeleton covered in wire.

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:05.500
Young Anakin Skywalker claimed that he had
built C-3PO himself, although C-3PO's databanks

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:09.920
had already existed, and his body was a wreck
until Anakin reconstructed him from spare

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:10.420
parts.

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:14.820
When Qui-Gon saw Anakin's potential to become
a Jedi, he won the boy's freedom from the

00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:20.270
junk dealer named Watto who had enslaved him
and his mother, Shmi, but she and C-3PO were

00:01:20.270 --> 00:01:21.260
forced to stay behind.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:26.060
When Padmé Amidala's term as Queen of Naboo
ended, she became a Senator.

00:01:26.160 --> 00:01:31.080
R2-D2 joined her on Coruscant, the Galactic
Capital, where the droid helped Obi-Wan Kenobi

00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:35.740
and a grown-up Anakin Skywalker foil an assassination
attempt on Padmé's life.

00:01:35.850 --> 00:01:41.300
This led Anakin to take her into hiding off-planet,
bringing R2-D2 along, but when Anakin began

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:44.860
having visions of his mother in peril, the
trio returned to Tatooine.

00:01:44.980 --> 00:01:49.920
There, they were reunited with C-3PO, who
now had a rusty metal covering that made him

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:51.940
look more like a typical protocol droid.

00:01:52.070 --> 00:01:56.580
They also learned that Shmi Skywalker had
been freed from slavery by a man named Cliegg

00:01:56.580 --> 00:01:58.140
Lars, who became her husband.

00:01:58.250 --> 00:02:03.240
After being freed, Shmi and C-3PO moved to
the Lars moisture farm, but Shmi was captured

00:02:03.240 --> 00:02:06.840
by Tusken Raiders, and died just as Anakin
arrived to save her.

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:12.800
C-3PO departed the Lars farm with Anakin and
Padmé, and he and R2-D2 accompanied them

00:02:12.820 --> 00:02:13.380
to Geonosis.

00:02:13.560 --> 00:02:18.200
There, they found their way into the foundry
where Battle Droids were built, and C-3PO's

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:21.020
head was swapped with a Battle Droid head,
much to his confusion.

00:02:21.220 --> 00:02:25.180
Fortunately, R2-D2 was able to reunite his
friend's head with his body.

00:02:25.180 --> 00:02:28.960
R2 and 3PO escaped with their allies, but
the Clone Wars had begun.

00:02:29.140 --> 00:02:33.020
The two droids then attended the secret wedding
of Anakin and Padmé on Naboo.

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:39.500
After six seasons of the animated series Star
Wars: The Clone Wars, R2-D2 and C-3PO have

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:42.020
had far too many adventures to recount them
all here.

00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:48.040
Suffice it to say that R2-D2 usually accompanied
Anakin Skywalker on missions, while C-3PO

00:02:48.049 --> 00:02:51.030
was more often the companion of Senator Padmé
Amidala.

00:02:51.030 --> 00:02:55.480
They did have a few adventures together, however,
such as when they accompanied Anakin and Padmé

00:02:55.480 --> 00:03:00.600
to Cato Neimoidia as part of a plan to expose
Rush Clovis as a Separatist spy.

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:05.719
While there, Padmé was poisoned and 3PO helped
a medical droid see to her recovery.

00:03:05.719 --> 00:03:09.560
The droids were heroes in their own right
when they were sent to the quake-ridden planet

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:11.540
Aleen as a part of a relief effort.

00:03:11.660 --> 00:03:16.160
When R2 and 3PO found themselves trapped beneath
the planet's surface, they discovered a way

00:03:16.160 --> 00:03:19.860
to stop the quakes, earning the eternal gratitude
of the Aleena people.

00:03:19.880 --> 00:03:25.620
In one of their strangest adventures, R2-D2
and C-3PO made an emergency landing on a planet

00:03:25.620 --> 00:03:27.680
where they were tied up by the miniature inhabitants.

00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:34.200
"May I say that this is no way to treat friendly
visitors to your planet."

00:03:34.700 --> 00:03:40.280
The tiny people brought them before their
dictator, Hay-Zu, but R2-D2 accidentally squashed

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:44.420
him, to the delight of the other citizens,
who then helped the droids repair their ship.

00:03:44.689 --> 00:03:49.739
C-3PO introduced them to the concept of democracy,
but it only led to more fighting as the droids

00:03:49.740 --> 00:03:50.540
made their escape.

00:03:50.760 --> 00:03:55.720
Then R2 and 3PO landed on the planet Balnab,
which was also ruled by a dictator.

00:03:55.860 --> 00:04:00.240
This one turned out to be a hologram operated
by a group of Pit Droids who were secretly

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:01.740
running the planet themselves.

00:04:02.540 --> 00:04:08.370
By the closing days of the Clone Wars, R2-D2
was Anakin's full-time co-pilot, while C-3PO

00:04:08.370 --> 00:04:09.870
stayed with Padmé on Coruscant.

00:04:09.870 --> 00:04:14.779
R2 accompanied Anakin and Obi-Wan Kenobi when
they boarded the flagship of Separatist military

00:04:14.779 --> 00:04:19.510
commander General Grievous, to rescue the
kidnapped Chancellor Palpatine, who was secretly

00:04:19.510 --> 00:04:20.280
a Sith Lord.

00:04:20.510 --> 00:04:25.020
R2 even fought off some Super Battle Droids
on his own, showing how much his abilities

00:04:25.020 --> 00:04:27.440
and personality had outstripped his programming.

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:32.620
He joined Anakin, Obi-Wan, and Palpatine on
the bridge as Anakin crash-landed the flagship

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:33.480
on Coruscant.

00:04:33.670 --> 00:04:38.780
C-3PO met up with R2-D2 soon thereafter, and
the two caught up on what they'd missed while

00:04:38.780 --> 00:04:39.480
they were apart.

00:04:40.700 --> 00:04:43.100
"Well, it couldn't possibly be as bad as all
that."

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:48.760
Anakin Skywalker soon fell under the sway
of Palpatine, and R2-D2 was noticeably unsettled

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:53.380
by his master's changing behavior, but still
accompanied him to the lava-strewn planet

00:04:53.380 --> 00:04:56.780
Mustafar, where Palpatine had sent him to
kill the Separatist leaders.

00:04:56.780 --> 00:05:01.990
When a distraught Padmé followed Anakin to
Mustafar, C-3PO piloted her ship himself,

00:05:01.990 --> 00:05:04.060
showing that he had gained new skills as well.

00:05:04.290 --> 00:05:08.400
While Obi-Wan and Anakin fought their fateful
duel, the droids helped an injured and very

00:05:08.400 --> 00:05:10.400
pregnant Padmé back onto her ship.

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:15.500
Both droids left Mustafar with Obi-Wan and
rendezvoused with Bail Organa of Alderaan

00:05:15.510 --> 00:05:20.000
. After Padmé died and her twin children,
Luke and Leia, were placed in hiding, Organa

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:24.100
gave the droids to Captain Raymus Antilles,
who commanded his flagship.

00:05:24.330 --> 00:05:28.100
To protect the twins from Emperor Palpatine
and Anakin, who had now fully become Darth

00:05:28.100 --> 00:05:32.200
Vader, Organa told Antilles to have C-3PO's
memory erased.

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:37.460
C-3PO and R2-D2 spent most of the time between
the end of the Clone Wars and the Battle of

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:43.110
Yavin serving Captain Antilles on board his
ship, the Tantive Four, which served as transport

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:47.580
for Alderaan's royal family and also flew
missions for the burgeoning Rebel Alliance.

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:52.310
They occasionally had other duties, however,
such as when Bail Organa sent them to escort

00:05:52.310 --> 00:05:57.540
Imperial Minister Tua and an Aqualish arms
dealer named Amda Wabo on a mission to the

00:05:57.540 --> 00:05:58.140
planet Garel.

00:05:58.260 --> 00:06:03.580
Officially, C-3PO was there to translate between
Tua and Wabo, who lacked a shared language,

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:07.760
but R2-D2 knew their true mission, which was
to prevent Tua and the Empire from getting

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:10.320
their hands on a shipment of powerful weapons.

00:06:10.320 --> 00:06:14.270
The two droids were also at the Rebel Alliance
base on Yavin Four in the lead-up to the Battle

00:06:14.270 --> 00:06:19.800
of Scarif, where a suicide mission by a ragtag
group of rebels enabled the Alliance to obtain

00:06:19.800 --> 00:06:23.580
the schematics to the planet-destroying Imperial
space station known as the Death Star.

00:06:23.780 --> 00:06:28.180
Unbeknownst to the Empire, the Imperial engineer
who had designed the moon-sized weapon had

00:06:28.180 --> 00:06:30.640
included a weakness that would enable its
destruction.

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:36.580
Ultimately the plans for the Death Star ended
up on the Tantive Four with R2 and 3PO aboard,

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:38.620
which would lead to their biggest adventure
yet.

00:06:39.180 --> 00:06:43.580
Princess Leia Organa was fleeing from Scarif
to Tatooine with the Death Star schematics

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:46.460
when Darth Vader's forces attacked and boarded
the ship.

00:06:46.690 --> 00:06:51.720
C-3PO and R2-D2 became the most important
droids in the galaxy when Leia hid the Death

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:53.980
Star files in R2's memory banks.

00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:58.270
C-3PO didn't know about the mission she'd
given R2, but still followed his friend to

00:06:58.270 --> 00:06:59.460
the surface of Tatooine.

00:07:01.060 --> 00:07:02.680
"How did we get into this mess?

00:07:03.020 --> 00:07:04.820
I really don't know how.

00:07:06.160 --> 00:07:07.980
We seem to be made to suffer.

00:07:08.080 --> 00:07:09.180
It's our lot in life."

00:07:10.120 --> 00:07:14.660
On the desert planet once again, the droids
were captured by Jawas and sold to Owen Lars

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:16.540
and his nephew, Luke Skywalker.

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:21.080
R2-D2, however, was determined to fulfill
his mission for Princess Leia by finding the

00:07:21.080 --> 00:07:23.030
exiled Jedi Obi-Wan Kenobi.

00:07:23.100 --> 00:07:27.460
He succeeded, along with 3PO and Luke, but
the Imperial search for the droids led to

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:29.120
the murder of Luke's aunt and uncle.

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:34.060
Soon after, the droids, Luke, and Obi-Wan
escaped Tatooine on board Han Solo's ship,

00:07:34.280 --> 00:07:35.280
the Millennium Falcon.

00:07:35.450 --> 00:07:39.820
After rescuing Leia from the Death Star, the
whole group arrived at Rebel Alliance headquarters

00:07:39.820 --> 00:07:40.740
on Yavin Four.

00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:45.550
When Luke volunteered to fly an X-Wing fighter
in the attack on the Death Star, R2-D2 performed

00:07:45.550 --> 00:07:49.590
the same function for him that he had for
his father, interfacing with the X-Wing's

00:07:49.590 --> 00:07:51.700
astromech slot to help the ship fly.

00:07:51.920 --> 00:07:56.660
He took serious damage in that battle, and
C-3PO even volunteered to donate parts for

00:07:56.661 --> 00:08:01.030
his repair, but the Rebels, grateful to Luke
for destroying the Death Star, did an exceptional

00:08:01.030 --> 00:08:02.800
job of repairing R2 on their own.

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:08.940
When the Rebels were forced to flee Yavin
for the ice planet Hoth, R2-D2 and C-3PO naturally

00:08:08.940 --> 00:08:09.600
came along.

00:08:09.700 --> 00:08:14.020
After assisting in the effort to locate Luke
and Han when they went missing, R2 and 3PO

00:08:14.020 --> 00:08:17.680
were forced to abandon the Hoth base along
with the rest of the Rebels when Imperial

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:18.560
forces arrived.

00:08:18.900 --> 00:08:23.720
C-3PO left with Han and Leia on the Millennium
Falcon, while R2-D2 left with Luke in his

00:08:23.720 --> 00:08:24.220
X-Wing.

00:08:24.380 --> 00:08:28.740
When the Millenium Falcon arrived in Cloud
City on the planet Bespin, 3PO wandered away

00:08:28.740 --> 00:08:31.940
from his friends and was blasted to pieces
by Stormtroopers.

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:36.779
Fortunately, those pieces were found by Chewbacca,
the tech-savvy Wookiee copilot of the Falcon,

00:08:36.780 --> 00:08:41.120
who was able to restore 3PO to consciousness
but didn't have a chance to fully reassemble

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:41.620
him.

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:46.400
Meanwhile, R2-D2 went with Luke Skywalker
to the swamp planet Dagobah, so Luke could

00:08:46.411 --> 00:08:48.060
train with the Jedi Master Yoda.

00:08:48.060 --> 00:08:52.040
R2's only role in Luke's Jedi training was
as a weight to be lifted with the Force, and

00:08:52.040 --> 00:08:54.740
he spent a lot of time sitting around waiting.

00:08:54.980 --> 00:08:59.080
Eventually, Luke had a vision of his friends
in peril on Bespin, and he and R2 left to

00:08:59.080 --> 00:08:59.580
save them.

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:04.560
There, R2 and the disassembled C-3PO were
reunited once again, and as they escaped on

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:08.020
the Falcon, R2 helped put his friend back
together.

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:12.080
Unfortunately, Han Solo had been captured
on Bespin and taken to the gangster known

00:09:12.080 --> 00:09:13.600
as Jabba the Hutt.

00:09:14.260 --> 00:09:18.720
C-3PO and R2-D2 were part of the mission to
rescue Han Solo from Jabba the Hutt, although

00:09:18.720 --> 00:09:22.740
as usual, 3PO wasn't nearly as informed about
the plan as R2.

00:09:23.420 --> 00:09:30.280
"We bring a message to your master, Jabba
the Hutt, and a gift -- gift, what gift?"

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:35.020
They arrived in Jabba's palace on Tatooine,
and R2 played a message from Luke Skywalker

00:09:35.029 --> 00:09:39.430
saying that both droids were gifts for the
Hutt. 3PO was horrified, but he served as

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:43.769
Jabba's new translator, while R2 carried a
drink tray on the Hutt's sail barge.

00:09:43.769 --> 00:09:48.120
Eventually the plan came together, and when
Luke needed his lightsaber for the rescue,

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:53.340
it turned out R2-D2 had been secretly carrying
it in a hidden compartment all along.

00:09:53.420 --> 00:09:57.800
C-3PO was much less help, and had one of his
eyes pulled out by Jabba's monkey-like companion,

00:09:57.800 --> 00:09:59.000
Salacious Crumb.

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:03.600
3PO was lucky that R2 shoved him off the sail
barge before it exploded, and their friends

00:10:03.600 --> 00:10:06.140
plucked them out of the sand before leaving
Tatooine.

00:10:06.220 --> 00:10:11.439
R2-D2 took a brief detour with Luke to return
to Dagobah for one last visit with Yoda before

00:10:11.440 --> 00:10:12.860
he died of old age.

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:16.980
Then both droids accompanied the Rebels on
a mission to the forest moon of Endor.

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:20.640
When they encountered the native population
a bunch of teddy bear-like creatures called

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:24.220
Ewoks the creatures mistook C-3PO for a god.

00:10:24.580 --> 00:10:28.380
With the help of Luke's Force abilities, 3PO
was able to prevent the surprisingly vicious

00:10:28.389 --> 00:10:32.499
Ewoks from cooking and eating the Rebels,
and their cooperation helped the Rebels defeat

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:33.500
the Empire.

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:39.120
After the victory at Endor, C-3PO continued
to serve Princess Leia and Han Solo as they

00:10:39.120 --> 00:10:42.180
rooted out Imperial holdouts and restored
the Republic.

00:10:42.180 --> 00:10:46.699
When the First Order arose to attempt to reinstate
a Galactic Empire, Leia became the General

00:10:46.700 --> 00:10:49.800
of the Resistance that opposed them, and 3PO
followed her.

00:10:49.820 --> 00:10:54.720
On a mission for the Resistance, C-3PO formed
an unlikely friendship with a captured First

00:10:54.720 --> 00:10:57.680
Order protocol droid named O-MR1.

00:10:57.920 --> 00:11:01.920
When the droids were trapped on a dangerous
planet, a tentacled creature ripped off 3PO's

00:11:01.940 --> 00:11:02.440
left arm.

00:11:02.480 --> 00:11:08.480
O-MR1 ultimately sacrificed himself to save
C-3PO, and 3PO wore his red arm for a time

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:09.620
in memory of his friend.

00:11:10.120 --> 00:11:12.820
"You probably don't recognize me because of
the red arm."

00:11:13.340 --> 00:11:18.779
As for R2-D2, he stuck by Luke Skywalker's
side as Luke built a new Jedi Temple and attempted

00:11:18.779 --> 00:11:20.749
to train a new generation of Jedi.

00:11:20.749 --> 00:11:25.519
Unfortunately, all of that was undone by Luke's
own nephew, Ben Solo, who led the mysterious

00:11:25.519 --> 00:11:29.500
Knights of Ren in slaughtering the other trainees
and destroying the temple.

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:32.320
R2 stood with his master as they watched the
Temple burn.

00:11:32.440 --> 00:11:36.959
Afterward, Luke left R2-D2 behind when he
went into hiding, and the exhausted droid

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:40.520
entered a low-power mode that he would maintain
for years.

00:11:41.080 --> 00:11:46.300
Still wearing O-MR1's red arm, C-3PO accompanied
General Leia Organa on a rescue mission to

00:11:46.300 --> 00:11:47.600
the planet Takodana.

00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:52.260
Back at the Resistance headquarters on D'Qar,
R2-D2 was still in hibernation mode when the

00:11:52.269 --> 00:11:56.240
Force prodigy Rey arrived and said that the
First Order already had found most of the

00:11:56.240 --> 00:12:00.840
map to Luke Skywalker's hiding place except
for the part that had been hidden in young

00:12:00.840 --> 00:12:01.620
droid BB-8.

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:06.040
Some part of R2 heard what Rey said, which
brought him out of his low-power coma.

00:12:06.260 --> 00:12:10.540
R2-D2 then helped BB-8 assemble the map to
Luke's hiding place on the planet Ahch-To.

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:15.580
Leaving C-3PO on D'Qar, R2 accompanied Rey
and Chewbacca on the Millennium Falcon to

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:16.240
find Luke.

00:12:17.320 --> 00:12:21.220
When the First Order uncovered the location
of the Resistance base on D'Qar, it was C-3PO

00:12:21.220 --> 00:12:25.550
who received the transmission and informed
Leia that they would have to evacuate.

00:12:25.550 --> 00:12:30.400
He and Leia and most of the rest of the Resistance
leadership escaped aboard the starship Raddus.

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:34.700
As the Raddus was pursued by the First Order,
the bridge was destroyed by TIE fighters,

00:12:34.700 --> 00:12:35.880
leaving Leia badly injured.

00:12:36.149 --> 00:12:40.220
C-3PO wanted nothing more than to stay by
her side while she recovered, but he found

00:12:40.230 --> 00:12:45.369
himself unwillingly involved in a mutiny led
by Poe Dameron against acting Resistance leader

00:12:45.369 --> 00:12:46.380
Admiral Holdo.

00:12:46.600 --> 00:12:50.220
When Leia woke up and stopped the mutiny,
3PO immediately surrendered.

00:12:50.220 --> 00:12:54.899
Meanwhile, R2-D2 was on the distant planet
of Ahch-To, where Rey was doing a poor job

00:12:54.900 --> 00:12:58.100
of convincing Luke Skywalker to train her
as a Jedi.

00:12:58.280 --> 00:13:02.760
Luke wanted nothing to do with teaching, but
R2-D2 changed his mind by playing the original

00:13:02.760 --> 00:13:06.360
recording of Leia that he'd delivered to Obi-Wan
Kenobi decades earlier.

00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:11.939
But before Rey's training was complete, she,
R2, and Chewbacca headed back to the Resistance.

00:13:11.939 --> 00:13:16.069
After Admiral Holdo sacrificed herself and
the Raddus to enable the other Resistance

00:13:16.069 --> 00:13:21.440
survivors to escape, C-3PO fled with Leia
and the others to the salty planet of Crait.

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:25.180
In the midst of a devastating attack from
the First Order, Luke Skywalker surprised

00:13:25.180 --> 00:13:30.660
everyone by arriving just in time to engage
his former protege Kylo Ren in combat.

00:13:30.800 --> 00:13:34.920
C-3PO seemed like he might have noticed something
askew about Luke, but he shut up about it

00:13:34.920 --> 00:13:35.800
when Luke winked at him.

00:13:36.160 --> 00:13:40.020
Sure enough, Luke turned out to only be a
Force projection, and not really on Crait

00:13:40.020 --> 00:13:40.980
at all.

00:13:41.200 --> 00:13:44.560
He was merely a distraction to give the Resistance
enough time to escape.

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:51.200
"This facility is such a maze of endless tunnels
that the odds of finding an exit are 15,428

00:13:51.200 --> 00:13:51.700
--"

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:52.580
"Shut up!"

00:13:53.220 --> 00:13:53.720
"...to one."

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:59.420
Nevertheless, Luke's gambit paid off, and
C-3PO was reunited with R2-D2 aboard the Millennium

00:13:59.420 --> 00:14:03.160
Falcon when Rey and Chewbacca arrived to help
with the evacuation.

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:09.680
In the final days of the war, as the First Order became the Final Order and Emperor Palpatine rose again, R2-D2

00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:17.160
remained at Resistance HQ while C-3PO went on a mission with the galaxy's greatest heroes to find the hidden Sith planet of Exegol.

00:14:17.300 --> 00:14:18.160
Along the way, they found

00:14:18.160 --> 00:14:22.900
a dagger that contained Sith runes that would show the way. 3PO was able to read the runes,

00:14:22.900 --> 00:14:27.560
but because they were Sith writing, his programming prevented him from translating them for his friends.

00:14:27.940 --> 00:14:32.580
In order to complete the mission, they had to go to a tiny droidsmith named Babu Frik, who was able to

00:14:32.580 --> 00:14:35.920
override the programming in C-3PO's electronic brain, but at the cost of his memory. Understanding the odds

00:14:37.760 --> 00:14:45.780
well enough to know that his sacrifice was necessary, C-3PO said goodbye to his friends and allowed his memory to be wiped for at least the second time.

00:14:45.980 --> 00:14:48.860
When he returned to the Resistance base, R2-D2 was surprised that his best friend didn't remember him.

00:14:49.120 --> 00:14:54.960
Although the amnesiac 3PO was reluctant at first to let the pushy Astromech droid mess with his head, R2 was

00:14:54.960 --> 00:15:00.480
able to restore his memory. Together, they celebrated the final defeat of Palpatine and the First Order.

00:15:00.680 --> 00:15:06.380
Just as they were there for Palpatine's rise, they were around for his fall. After all, aren't they the real stars of the saga?

